2. **Specify the server-side attachment identity source (finding 4).** `ws.md` Serving section: handover mints the identity; the composition receives the attach-shaped pair as data; 4c wires it. Blocks 4a/4c at the correlation rule's load-bearing point. *Disputable: delivery mechanism — boundary accept event vs. constructor-handed pair.*
